{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2123","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Modular Sorting"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer $$$m$$$ ($$$2\\leq m\\leq 5\\cdot 10^5$$$) and an array $$$a$$$ consisting of nonnegative integers smaller than $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Answer queries of the following form: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ $$$i$$$ $$$x$$$: assign $$$a_i := x$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$2$$$ $$$k$$$: in one operation, you may choose an element $$$a_i$$$ and assign $$$a_i := (a_i + k) \\pmod m$$$$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$ — determine if there exists some sequence of (possibly zero) operations to make $$$a$$$ nondecreasing$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that instances of query $$$2$$$ are independent; that is, no actual operations are taking place. Instances of query $$$1$$$ are persistent."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$$$$a\\pmod m$$$ is defined as the unique integer $$$b$$$ such that $$$0\\leq b \\lt m$$$ and $$$a-b$$$ is an integer multiple of $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$An array $$$a$$$ of size $$$n$$$ is called nondecreasing if and only if $$$a_i\\leq a_{i+1}$$$ for all $$$1\\leq i \\lt n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1\\leq t\\leq 10^4$$$)  — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains three integers, $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$q$$$ ($$$2\\leq n \\leq 10^5$$$, $$$2\\leq m\\leq 5\\cdot10^5$$$, $$$1\\leq q\\leq 10^5$$$) — the size of the array $$$a$$$, the integer $$$m$$$, and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers, $$$a_1,a_2,\\dots,a_n$$$ ($$$0\\leq a_i \\lt m$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then follows $$$q$$$ lines. Each line is of one of the following forms: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1$$$ $$$i$$$ $$$x$$$ ($$$1\\leq i\\leq n$$$, $$$0\\leq x \\lt m$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$2$$$ $$$k$$$ ($$$1\\leq k \\lt m$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ and the sum of $$$q$$$ over all test cases each do not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each instance of query $$$2$$$, output on a single line \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if there exists some sequence of (possibly zero) operations to make $$$a$$$ nondecreasing, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output the answer in any case (upper or lower). For example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as positive responses."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n7 6 6\n4 5 2 2 4 1 0\n2 4\n1 4 5\n2 4\n2 3\n1 7 2\n2 3\n8 8 3\n0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7\n2 4\n1 3 4\n2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, the array is initially: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"By applying the operation twice on $$$a_1$$$, twice on $$$a_2$$$, once on $$$a_5$$$, twice on $$$a_6$$$, and once on $$$a_7$$$, the array becomes: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"},{"kind":"text","text":" which is in nondecreasing order."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the second query, the array becomes: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"},{"kind":"text","text":" and it can be shown that it is impossible to sort this with operations of the form $$$a_i := (a_i+4)\\pmod 6$$$, and it is also impossible to sort this with operations of the form $$$a_i := (a_i+3)\\pmod 6$$$."}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"2123G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2123/problem/G"}